# Operator-supplied secrets — gitignored as `.env.oci`. Copy this file
# and fill in. The Makefile sources `.env.oci` and refuses to deploy
# without ANTHROPIC_API_KEY set.
#
# Required (all modes):
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET=
# ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@example.com

# Parent mode only — the Makefile reads ~/.okesu-secrets/federation/token
# (terraform-generated) and injects FEDERATION_TOKEN automatically. Override
# here only if you want to override the terraform-generated value.
# FEDERATION_TOKEN=

# Child mode only — paste from the parent's `make oci-print MODE=parent`:
# PARENT_FEDERATION_BUCKET=
# PARENT_FEDERATION_ENDPOINT=
# PARENT_FEDERATION_REGION=
# PARENT_FEDERATION_ACCESS_KEY=
# PARENT_FEDERATION_SECRET_KEY=
# PARENT_FEDERATION_TOKEN=
# CP_INSTANCE_ID=cp-child-001
